Reviewed-by: Yuxin Hu <yuxinhu@google.com>
Reviewed-by: Geoff Lang <geofflang@chromium.org>
Commit-Queue: Ran Wang <wangra@google.com>
(cherry picked from commit a871bdb05932b9bbaf511e531a8497cf1a6e1865)

